  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Capacities of the Jordanian Armed Forces to Provide Urgent Trauma Care at The North-East Border Area</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In direct response to the increased instability in Jordan&#x2019;s neighbouring region the Jordanian Armed Forces (JAF) are increasing their efforts in upholding the territorial integrity of Jordan. The borderline has also been witnessing an increase of civil crossing, especially through the border triangle for the purpose of seeking refuge. Furthermore, this addition to Jordanian border strength will help oppose any possible economic fallout that emerges from the Ukrainian &amp; Russian crises. The purpose of this project is to further IOM&#x2019;s support to JAF in this endeavour, with the overall aim to strengthen their capacity to conduct their mission in upholding the territorial integrity of Jordan in accordance with Humanitarian Border Management and Health, Border and Mobility Management framework as a part of the Migration Crisis Operational Framework.</narrative>
  </description>
